<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Globe Talk - Live AI Operating Room</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 16px;
      background: #0b0f19;
      color: #f3f4f6;
      font-family: sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .card {
      background: #111827;
      border: 1px solid #ef4444;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 24px;
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
    }
    h1 {
      color: #f87171;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .badge {
      background: #1e293b;
      color: #38bdf8;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
    }
    .info {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }
    .btn {
      background: #ef4444;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 14px;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      background: #dc2626;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>🌐 Globe Talk</h1>
    <span class="badge">🟢 AI Supreme Court Online</span>
    <p class="info"><b>Short Videos • Voice Rooms • Direct Calling • AI Supreme Justice</b></p>
    <p class="info"><b>Supreme Host:</b> Regina | <b>Bench:</b> 3 AI Judges</p>
    <p class="info">इकोनॉमी: ₹1 = 100 कॉइन्स | ₹2 में 7 दिन VIP ट्रायल</p>
    <button class="btn" onclick="alert('Globe Talk AI सिस्टम पूरी तरह सक्रिय है!')">एआई रूम टेस्ट करें</button>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
